# Integer32 multiplication within range

Verifies int32 multiplication with operands chosen to stay inside the 32-bit
range through the complete CLI pipeline.

>>> source
left: int32 = 40000
right: int32 = 50000
neg_left: int32 = -40000

// Verifies multiplication of two positive operands.
pos_product: int32 = left * right
print(pos_product)

// Verifies multiplication with opposite signs.
mixed_product: int32 = neg_left * right
print(mixed_product)

<<< stdout
2000000000
-2000000000

<<< stderr
